{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Espire blends the classic spy-thriller action of titles like <i>Goldeneye 007</i> and <i>Metal Gear Solid</i> with the unparalleled immersion of modern VR technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The technology of virtual reality has been militarized. You are an Espire Operative, piloting the remote &quot;Model 1 Frame\u201d from your cutting-edge <strong>Control Theater</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate a secure IFA Facility, identify and track down the OPHIS threats, and eliminate them. Stealth is your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Definitive VR Stealth:\u00a0</strong>Mechanics built from the ground up for VR. Use gadgets, weapons, and silence to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Control:</strong> Use the headset microphone to hold up guards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Immersion:\u00a0</strong>No complex button combos. Crouch, lean, disarm soldiers, take cover, and reload your weapons using your physical body 1:1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart AI:\u00a0</strong>Enemies actively hunt you. They respond to sight, sound, and suspicion levels based on your physical stance and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Campaign:</strong> Experience a complete single-player story mode, or tackle over 75 objective-based challenge missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Enter our weekly challenges and compete for the highest scores worldwide based on mission time, stealth, ammo conservation, and takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Freedom of Movement:\u00a0</strong>The &quot;Control Theater&quot; comfort system is both a story element and <strong>comfort feature</strong>, allowing you to move anywhere\u2014climbing and falling freely\u2014without the motion sickness common in other VR titles. This <strong>optional feature</strong> can be disabled.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8a5011e2e77cd019a161e243cf5d9ed746266ffe.jpg","localized_name":"Lab Work","name":"Lab Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/8a5011e2e77cd019a161e243cf5d9ed746266ffe.jpg"},{"icon":"b5553885cad983c8a4b485c377284b6874cd40b4.jpg","localized_name":"Lunch Break's Over","name":"Lunch Break's Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/b5553885cad983c8a4b485c377284b6874cd40b4.jpg"},{"icon":"e25f8d4295cc16c7d8e941edc567a791e751388c.jpg","localized_name":"Just Getting Started","name":"Just Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/e25f8d4295cc16c7d8e941edc567a791e751388c.jpg"},{"icon":"99049ce7c86eeec99346034d3c5a5aac36209e51.jpg","localized_name":"On Track","name":"On Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/99049ce7c86eeec99346034d3c5a5aac36209e51.jpg"},{"icon":"85ef95a334e8b650a361c437b498fe55cdfc23df.jpg","localized_name":"Going Up","name":"Going Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/85ef95a334e8b650a361c437b498fe55cdfc23df.jpg"},{"icon":"f585d19f55da865f4b26bc240b587d68b63c77ba.jpg","localized_name":"Close Call","name":"Close Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/f585d19f55da865f4b26bc240b587d68b63c77ba.jpg"},{"icon":"fd2382cf518d6082fb654b34c85deb1337dee50f.jpg","localized_name":"Espire is a Real-Reality","name":"Espire is a Real-Reality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/669290/fd2382cf518d6082fb654b34c85deb1337dee50f.jpg"},{"icon":"abe1bf822e3b330791596a07432363c