 from armed guards. \r\nEspire is game where violence is not encouraged, and players have a non-lethal approach to every scenario. \r\n\r\nHowever, there is gun violence throughout the title. Our gameplay and release trailers give an indication of the type of violence present throughout the title. \r\n\r\nPlayers have the ability to disable blood effects in the 'display' options, found via the 'settings' menu. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Espire blends the classic spy-thriller action of titles like <i>Goldeneye 007</i> and <i>Metal Gear Solid</i> with the unparalleled immersion of modern VR technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The technology of virtual reality has been militarized. You are an Espire Operative, piloting the remote &quot;Model 1 Frame\u201d from your cutting-edge <strong>Control Theater</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate a secure IFA Facility, identify and track down the OPHIS threats, and eliminate them. Stealth is your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Definitive VR Stealth:\u00a0</strong>Mechanics built from the ground up for VR. Use gadgets, weapons, and silence to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Control:</strong> Use the headset microphone to hold up guards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Immersion:\u00a0</strong>No complex button combos. Crouch, lean, disarm soldiers, take cover, and reload your weapons using your physical body 1:1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart AI:\u00a0</strong>Enemies actively hunt you. They respond to sight, sound, and suspicion levels based on your physical stance and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Campaign:</strong> Experience a complete single-player story mode, or tackle over 75 objective-based challenge missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Enter our weekly challenges and compete for the highest scores worldwide based on mission time, stealth, ammo conservation, and takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Freedom of Movement:\u00a0</strong>The &quot;Control Theater&quot; comfort system is both a story element and <strong>comfort feature</strong>, allowing you to move anywhere\u2014climbing and falling freely\u2014without the motion sickness common in other VR titles. This <strong>optional feature</strong> can be disabled.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Lode Immersive Media"],"dlc":[2932030,2411710],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669290/40a1efece453e7c3ec0740b96ceaff0d16f43360/header.jpg?t=1767750361","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Espire VR Pty Ltd trading as Digital Lode Immersive Media. Designed and developed in Melbourne, Australia.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/669290/253843/d5ab97ecd202737d16ace76f495c4d7b0a59c5ac/1751128697/dash_av1.mpd?t=1574437777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/669290/253843/d5ab97ecd202737d16ace76f495c4d7b0a59c5ac/1751128697/dash_h264.mpd?t=1574437777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/669290/253843/d5ab97ecd202737d16ace76f495c4d7b0a59c5ac/1751128697/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1574437777","id":256767887,"name":"Es